**Daisuke.** A shallow celebrity singer cursed to transform into a
rabbit at a woman's romantic touch. A wealthy, womanizing pop idol,
Daisuke rudely dismissed an elderly fan who asked for an autograph --
and she cursed him on the spot. Now any woman's amorous touch turns
him into a handsome black rabbit until he escapes her sight, clothes
and all left behind. Chastened but hardly reformed, he's determined to
track the old woman down and get the curse lifted. Lecherous,
self-absorbed, and far too famous for his own good, Daisuke's biggest
problems are entirely of his own making -- when he isn't chasing
girls, he's complaining about his food. *Agile +2, Attack +1 (Kung
Faux), Beautiful +2, Combat Expert +1, Famous +3, Knowledge +2
(Motorcycles), Performer +3, Quick +1, Vigorous +1, Wealthy +3;
Accidental Transformation −3 (Black Bunny), Impulsive −1, Lecherous
−2, Love Interest −1 (Himself), Love Magnet −3, Overconfident −1,
Quirk −1 (Odd Food Demands), Rude −1, Weak-Willed −1.* Crouching
Rabbit, Hidden Bunny (Affinity: Martial Arts): Roll 5, DX 2, End 0.
Daisuke's fondness for martial arts movies has led to spending
megabucks on tutors. This Axe Goes to 11! (Effective x3; Ammunition
x3): Roll 5, DX 5, End 0. In desperation, Daisuke can sacrifice his
guitar to save his hide…. Defense 3. Health 40, Endurance 50. TV 11.

